  "design_decisions": [
    "Dual H-Bridge: 4x IR2104S half-bridge gate drivers + 8x AO3400A N-MOSFETs",
    "IR2104S (SOIC-8): VCC=1, HIN=2, LIN=3, COM=4, LO=5, VS=6, HO=7, VB=8",
    "AO3400A (SOT-23): Gate=1, Source=2, Drain=3",
    "Bootstrap: 1N4148W diode + 1uF cap per gate driver",
    "Gate resistors: 10R series on all MOSFET gates",
    "Current sense: 0.2R on low-side return of each H-bridge",
    "GD32F150C8T6: 8 GPIO for HIN/LIN control, USB on PA11/PA12",
    "Power: VIN → SS34 → L1 ferrite → 3V3 LDO + VMOTOR",
    "INA180A2IDBVT (C116203, SOT-23-5): current sense amp, gain=50V/V, 0.2R × 50V/V = 10mV/mA. At 500mA → 5V output. INA180 pins: OUT=1, GND=2, IN-=3, IN+=4, VCC=5"
  ]
}